    "name": "Black Pellet",
    "steam_appid": 3395910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395910/extras/23bc8f35febada6a8f3a03160e97f130.avif?t=1749106825\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>From the ruins of the old civilization, a new West, brutal and savage, is reborn. Against the cruelty that rules the world, a man saves a dog from a tragic ending. They will join forces to survive the surrounding chaos. Experience an epic journey accompanied by your loyal dog, Pellet, and help him get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395910/extras/fa07d25f819392c50a5f4a7fb0763765.avif?t=1749106825\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam a living and breathing\u00a0<strong>open world</strong> filled with ruthless inhabitants, fierce animals, and unforgiving lands. <strong>Survive</strong> by <strong>gathering</strong> <strong>resources</strong> around you and finding a good location to set up your <strong>camp</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in exciting <strong>shootouts</strong> and <strong>duels</strong> inspired by the <strong>western</strong> genre. T<strong>hird person shooter</strong> mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat enemies in a brutal <strong>hand to hand combat</strong> or use melee <strong>weapons</strong> for even deadlier effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let <strong>Pellet</strong> be your guide in the wasteland. Use your dog's abilities to <strong>track targets</strong>, <strong>hunt beasts,</strong> and look for <strong>treasures</strong>\u00a0and useful materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> forgotten and inaccessible places where mysteries and rare artifacts remain using the <strong>parkour mechanics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get and upgrade <strong>armored vehicles</strong> to travel on the dangerous roads.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Pellet</strong> to help you in open <strong>combat</strong> or to better execute <strong>stealth</strong> strategies. He improves his skills the more you train him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>real</strong> and beautiful <strong>claymations</strong> as <strong>cinematic sequences</strong> in the main story missions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395910/extras/0589450504b8ea49be75038938b8c3d4.avif?t=1749106825\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395910/extras/23bc8f35febada6a8f3a03160e97f130.avif?t=1749106825\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>From the ruins of the old civilization, a new West, brutal and savage, is reborn. Against the cruelty that rules the world, a man saves a dog from a tragic ending. They will join forces to survive the surrounding chaos. Experience an epic journey accompanied by your loyal dog, Pellet, and help him get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395910/extras/fa07d25f819392c50a5f4a7fb0763765.avif?t=1749106825\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam a living and breathing\u00a0<strong>open world</strong> filled with ruthless inhabitants, fierce animals, and unforgiving lands. <strong>Survive</strong> by <strong>gathering</strong> <strong>resources</strong> around you and finding a good location to set up your <strong>camp</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in exciting <strong>shootouts</strong> and <strong>duels</strong> inspired by the <strong>western</strong> genre. T<strong>hird person shooter</strong> mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat enemies in a brutal <strong>hand to hand combat</strong> or use melee <strong>weapons</strong> for even deadlier effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let <strong>Pellet</strong> be your guide in the wasteland. Use your dog's abilities to <strong>track targets</strong>, <strong>hunt beasts,</strong> and look for <strong>treasures</strong>\u00a0and useful materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> forgotten and inaccessible places where mysteries and rare artifacts remain using the <strong>parkour mechanics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get and upgrade <strong>armored vehicles</strong> to travel on the dangerous roads.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Pellet</strong> to help you in open <strong>combat</strong> or to better execute <strong>stealth</strong> strategies. He improves his skills the more you train him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>real</strong> and beautiful <strong>claymations</strong> as <strong>cinematic sequences</strong> in the main story missions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395910/extras/0589450504b8ea49be75038938b8c3d4.avif?t=1749106825\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
